      en: ["Kigoma is the primary port on Lake Tanganyika, the deepest lake in Africa.", "It is the home base for the historic MV Liemba vessel, in service for over 100 years.", "The port serves as the western terminus of the Central Line railway from Dar es Salaam.", "It connects Tanzania with Congo, Burundi, and Zambia via lake routes.", "The port facilities are situated at an altitude of approximately 773 meters.", "The harbor was originally developed by German and Belgian colonial administrations."],
