      en: ["Isaka is a major Inland Container Depot (ICD), commonly known as a dry port.", "It is located approximately 482 kilometers from the Rwandan border at Rusumo.", "The port serves as the primary transit hub for goods destined for Rwanda and Burundi.", "It facilitates the intermodal transfer from railway transport to road trucking.", "Isaka is situated within the Shinyanga Region in northern Tanzania.", "The development of the new Standard Gauge Railway (SGR) will significantly boost capacity."],
